    {
      "id": "claim_4152953c19b54e59aebdba644ded252b",
      "statement": "Per-user credentials and policies are stored in scsp.tb_user_policy, whose s_hash_password and s_policy columns are returned together by GetUserCredentials; the raw policy string is what AuthUseCase returns and the middleware stores in the Gin context.",
