    {
      "id": "claim_2729aea008154918b7110ce2f9f87f68",
      "statement": "A user's policy is a JSON array of {path, roles} entries (Policy struct with json tags path and roles); PolicyMiddleware grants access only when a single entry's Path is a strings.HasPrefix match on the normalized request key-path AND that same entry's Roles contains the route's required role.",
