      "id": "claim_3406cfe31a8f49f59d5a07bb66932417",
      "statement": "Policy evaluation failure modes are surfaced distinctly: missing username returns 401, missing policy in context returns 403 \"Forbidden: No policy found\", non-string or unparsable policy JSON returns 500, and an insufficient role returns 403 \"Forbidden: Insufficient permissions\" with a warn log naming user, role, and path.",
